sentences.text:
9. Let the applicant Hori Lal alias Shivam be released on bail in Case Crime No. 330 of 2022, under Sections 342, 376 IPC and 5M/6 of Protection of Children from Sexual Offences Act, Police Station Bihar, District Unnao on furnishing a bail bond and two sureties each in the like amount to the satisfaction of magistrate/court concerned, subject to following conditions:-
(i) the applicant shall not temper with the prosecution evidence;
(ii) the applicant shall not pressurize the prosecution witnesses;
(iii) the applicant shall appear on each and every date fixed by the trial court.
10.

